<title>UK: C Lyonnais warrants on China Petro.</title>
<headline>C Lyonnais warrants on China Petro.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd has issued 10 million American-style call warrants on shares of China Petrochemical Corp, Credit Lyonnais said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    TW$39.899		 PREMIUM	12.15 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     TW$9.82		   GEARING	4.51 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   20.FEB.98		 PAYDATE	10.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT 10,000</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  TW$44.3322</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
